From 861b1d5f78725a2f2abbeb7a52edc2ed493070da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:41:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Nano-X on the DS: unix socket instead of TCP loopback
 (NANOX_TCP=1 for the old way); minimise box next to the close box; caption
 painting without per-paint answered requests (cached GC and system colours);
 focus handed on when a window is minimised or closed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
